WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.550
Every Sunday at Mass, Catholics
say four words about the Church.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.440
One.

3
00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.330
Holy.

4
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.260
Catholic.

5
00:00:07.310 --> 00:00:08.470
Apostolic.

6
00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:11.850
Orthodox and Anglican
Christians say the same words.

7
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.510
But look round any parish, and you'll
find ordinary people who get things wrong.

8
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.000
So how can Catholics call the Church holy,

9
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.270
when the people in it are sinners?

10
00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:24.230
In this mission, you'll
unpack all four marks,

11
00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:27.230
from one faith to a worldwide family.

12
00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:31.120
Then you'll trace a chain that runs from
the first apostles to the bishops of

13
00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.150
today.

14
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:36.740
Your mission: find out how Catholics
can call the Church holy when the people

15
00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:37.800
in it sin.
